    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21510" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">illex</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inl-</span></b> ), ēgis, adj.
